SteelChef_NY_Goal_Counter = "You must learn some old skating techniques. We'll start with the No Comply. Failure will bring disgrace to my name and restaurant."
SteelChef_NY_Goal_Gaps4 = "Good! You learn quickly. Apply this technique to jump over an obstacle."
SteelChef_NY_Goal_Gaps5 = "The harmony of old vs. new will be delicious! No Comply onto the bench, manual and then flip-trick out."
SteelChef_NY_Goal_Counter2_CamAnim01 = "Soon we will fuse the Boneless into modern skating.  But first you must practice."
SteelChef_NY_Goal_Counter2 = "Remember, the Boneless will give you extra height and distance."
SteelChef_NY_Goal_Gaps6 = "Normally this wall would be almost impossible to jump over.  But with a Boneless it's a simple task."
SteelChef_NY_Goal_Gaps7_CamAnim01 = "This will be the ultimate fusion of new and old. Get some speed and boneless off the lip of this Quarter Pipe."
SteelChef_NY_Goal_Gaps7_CamAnim02 = "This should give you enough air to do a huge vert trick."
SteelChef_NY_Goal_Gaps7 = "Accomplishing this will bring great honor to us!"

